  "description": "PDF generation for .NET with an immutable, fluent C# API: text wrapping and styles, columns, rows, tables, images, headers/footers, automatic pagination, page numbers, embedded subset fonts and Arabic right-to-left text.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
